>KOGA, YASUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITSUSHIO, TAKAFUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKASHIMA, HARUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKUMURA, SHINJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A welding voltage is determined based on an expression, P=k2 x Vw&lt;2&gt; + k3 x Vw, where, with a welding wire feed speed and a welding wire radius used as inputs, a power is P (kW), a melting speed of a welding wire Vw(g/sec), and k2 and k3 constants (k2=0.898, and k3=4.625).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Selon la présente invention, une tension de soudage est déterminée en fonction d'une expression, P=k2 x Vw&lt;2&gt; + k3 x Vw. Dans cette expression, où la vitesse d'alimentation du fil-électrode et le rayon du fil-électrode sont des données d'entrée, P(kW) représente la puissance, Vw (g/s) représente la vitesse de soudage d'un fil-électrode et k2 et k3 sont des constantes (k2 = 0,898 et k3 = 4,625).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>